6. Font: Let's Jazz
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/assets/fonts/lets-jazz-regular.otf and .woff2. Designer: Unio | Creative
Solutions. The font's embedded notice reads "Copyright (c) 2019 by Unio |
Creative Solutions. All rights reserved." and names no licence. The designer
